<title>USA: AMEX closing averages.</title>
<headline>AMEX closing averages.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Prices on the American Stock Exchange closed higher in heavy trading.</p>
<p>The Amex Composite index closed at 619.57, up 4.92, a new record. The new high beat the exchange's record set on May 22, 1996, when the average hit 617.61.</p>
<p>The average price per share rose $0.12.</p>
<p>Advancers beat decliners 304 to 264.</p>
<p>Preliminary volume was 22,901,995 compared with 29,287,190 on Thursday.</p>
<p>(Prices official as of 1630 EST/2130 GMT)</p>
<p>((-- Wall Street desk, 212-859-1881))</p>
